{
  "__instructions": [
    "Copy this file to app/google-services.json and replace every YOUR_* placeholder with values",
    "from Firebase Console > Project Settings > Your apps. Do not commit the result: it is ignored",
    "by .gitignore.",
    "",
    "One Firebase project, four Android apps. Register all four package names below, otherwise the",
    "Google Services plugin fails the build for whichever variant it cannot find:",
    "  com.prabhix.operator          OneOps, release",
    "  com.prabhix.operator.debug    OneOps, debug",
    "  com.prabhix.admin             Admin, release",
    "  com.prabhix.admin.debug       Admin, debug",
    "",
    "The plugin ignores keys it does not recognise, so this block can stay in the real file.",
    "",
    "The server side is already done: it posts to FCM using PUSH_PROVIDER=FCM, FCM_PROJECT_ID and",
    "FCM_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON, which are a separate service-account key from anything here."
  ],
